    "status": "PASS",
    "source": "Same quantity on both sides: volumes of the 20 mm box and of the box minus the 10x10x15 tool from z=0, and the face and concave/convex pair counts of the cut result. Bridge: Shape.volume of both, then AAG.nodes.count and the AAG edges whose convexity (OCCTEdgeGetConvexity) is concave and convex; the test observed a smaller result volume and detectPocketsAAG() returned 1 pocket (the pocket count is a Swift-level result of these concave pairs and is not carried on either side). Kernel: BRepAlgoAPI_Cut, BRepGProp::VolumeProperties, and ChFi3d::DefineConnectType (SinTol 0.01, CorrectPoint true) on the first shared edge of each pair; detectPocket line of the transcript at %.17g.",
